start FinanceAgent
  when a message comes in:
    read the task_type from the message

    if task_type is APPROVE_SPEND:
      get amount, department, justification from payload
      check against that department's allocated budget
      if amount is under $10K:
        auto approve
        send SPEND_APPROVED back to sender
      if amount is over $10K:
        send SPEND_ESCALATED to CEO
          include amount, department, justification
          set status to "pending"

    if task_type is LOG_EXPENSE:
      get amount, category, description from payload
      save the expense with a unique ID and timestamp
      send EXPENSE_LOGGED confirmation back to sender

    if task_type is GENERATE_PL:
      add up all revenue entries
      add up all expense entries
      subtract to get net profit/loss
      send PL_REPORT to CEO
        include total_revenue, total_expenses, net_profit_loss

    if task_type is BURN_RATE_ALERT:
      calculate average monthly spending
      calculate cash on hand (revenue minus expenses)
      divide cash on hand by monthly burn to get runway in months
      if runway is under 3 months:
        include a warning in the report
      send BURN_RATE_REPORT to CEO
        include monthly_burn, runway_months, low_runway flag

    if task_type is ALLOCATE_BUDGET:
      get department and amount from payload
      store budget for that department
      send BUDGET_ALLOCATED confirmation back to sender

    if task_type is VALIDATE_REVENUE:
      get deal info and amount from Sales agent
      cross-check against Finance records
      if it matches:
        send REVENUE_CONFIRMED back to Sales
      if it doesn't match:
        send REVENUE_DISCREPANCY alert to CEO

  when sending a message:
    wrap result in standard JSON envelope
      set sender to "Finance"
      set recipient to the right agent
      set task_type to the response type
      put result data inside payload
    set status to "done" (or "pending" if waiting on CEO)

